flowchart TD
  A{Host observation adapter} -- Phone APK --> N[Check read rules and local / connected route]
  N --> NOT[Permitted notification text + allowed launchable apps]
  A -- AndroidWorld core harness --> TREE[Structured UI tree + host capabilities]
  NOT --> FILTER[Deterministic Rust filter: no model call]
  TREE --> FILTER
  FILTER --> STRUCT[Planner view: control IDs, labels, state, bounded values]
  FILTER --> CONTENT[Private content map: c1, c2... to source text]
  STRUCT --> P[Planner sees content references, not raw bodies]
  P -- Element read requested --> ER[Reader model sees selected content candidates]
  CONTENT --> ER
  ER --> VALID{One allowed element ID or none?}
  VALID -- Yes --> RET[Core returns ID + source tag to next planner step]
  VALID -- No --> REJ[Core rejects response; no tool executed]
  P -- Summary explicitly requested by owner --> SR[Reader selects source excerpts]
  CONTENT --> SR
  SR --> CHECK[Validate excerpts; observe again and check freshness]
  CHECK --> OWNER[Return excerpts or unavailable status to OWNER; end run]
